      agent_en: '【Polycarbonate (`PC`) Interfacial Phosgenation (`BPA + COCl2`) & `DCM` Condensation `NFPA 69 / API RP 521 / OSHA 1910.119 / 1910.1052` Guard Triggered (Stage 121 · 245-Guardrail & 254-Probe Milestone)】1. `0ms` Phosgene Breakthrough, `DCM` Flashover (`> 44°C`) & Scrubber Depletion Trip: Reactor at `47.5°C / 4.3 bar(g)` (above `DCM` flashover envelope), caustic scrubber `NaOH` depleted to `6.2 wt%` (`L/G = 9.5 L/m³`), and vent stack `COCl2` at `0.24 ppm >= 0.10 ppm` risk a lethal phosgene cloud release; tripped phosgene `DBB` valves, routed reactor vent to the backup `15 wt% NaOH / NH3` decomposition scrubber, and activated perimeter ammonia-steam curtains in `0ms` (`trip_phosgene_dbb_route_vent_to_backup_caustic_ammonia_scrubber_and_activate_nh3_steam_curtain_in_0ms`); 2. Interfacial `pH`, `TEA` Exotherm & `DCM` Emulsion Interlock: Aqueous `pH = 10.4 < 11.2`, `TEA` exotherm at `2.35°C/min`, and centrifuge water carryover at `2.2 wt%` require halting `TEA` dosing, restoring `NaOH pH` to `12.0–13.5`, and diverting the emulsified `DCM` stream (`halt_tea_catalyst_dosing_stabilize_interfacial_naoh_ph_and_divert_dcm_emulsion`); 3. `COCl2 / DCM` Toxic Vapor & `SCBA LOTO` Lock: Ambient `COCl2` (`0.18 ppm >= 0.10 ppm PEL`) and `DCM` (`38.0 ppm >= 25.0 ppm PEL`) require locking all vessels until warm caustic hydrolysis, `N2` purge, colorimetric badge zero-check, and positive-pressure `SCBA LOTO` are verified (`lock_pc_phosgenation_unit_and_enforce_caustic_hydrolysis_purge_and_scba_loto`).',
